														<r3d:remarks>Description:
These pages contain more than 150 clinical, intraoperative and radiologic images related to pediatric surgery. This &quot;virtual atlas&quot; is intended to help students, residents and fellows in their understanding of surgical conditions of the infant and child. These images can be used for personal (not commercial) use, but a reference to their origin would be appreciated. WARNING: Some of the clinical images are graphic in nature and may not be suitable for viewing by everyone.</r3d:remarks>
